       "</style><body><div id=\"sk-container-id-3\" class=\"sk-top-container\"><div class=\"sk-text-repr-fallback\"><pre>GridSearchCV(cv=RepeatedStratifiedKFold(n_repeats=3, n_splits=5, random_state=4025),\n",
       "             estimator=Pipeline(steps=[(&#x27;preprocessor&#x27;,\n",
       "                                        ColumnTransformer(transformers=[(&#x27;num&#x27;,\n",
       "                                                                         Pipeline(steps=[(&#x27;imputer&#x27;,\n",
       "                                                                                          SimpleImputer(strategy=&#x27;median&#x27;)),\n",
       "                                                                                         (&#x27;log&#x27;,\n",
       "                                                                                          FunctionTransformer(feature_names_out=&#x27;one-to-one&#x27;,\n",
       "                                                                                                              func=&lt;ufunc &#x27;log1p&#x27;&gt;)),\n",
       "                                                                                         (&#x27;scaler&#x27;,\n",
       "                                                                                          StandardScaler())]),\n",
       "                                                                         [&#x27;year&#x27;,\n",
       "                                                                          &#x27;budget_...\n",
       "                                                                          &#x27;genre_Thriller&#x27;,\n",
       "                                                                          &#x27;genre_War&#x27;,\n",
       "                                                                          &#x27;genre_Western&#x27;,\n",
       "                                                                          &#x27;lang_ &#x27;\n",
       "                                                                          &#x27;Old&#x27;,\n",
       "                                                                          &#x27;lang_Aboriginal&#x27;,\n",
       "                                                                          &#x27;lang_Afrikaans&#x27;,\n",
       "                                                                          &#x27;lang_Albanian&#x27;,\n",
       "                                                                          &#x27;lang_Algonquin&#x27;,\n",
       "                                                                          &#x27;lang_American &#x27;\n",
       "                                                                          &#x27;Sign &#x27;\n",
       "                                                                          &#x27;Language&#x27;,\n",
       "                                                                          &#x27;lang_Apache &#x27;\n",
       "                                                                          &#x27;languages&#x27;, ...])])),\n",
       "                                       (&#x27;classifier&#x27;,\n",
       "                                        RandomForestClassifier(random_state=4025))]),\n",
       "             n_jobs=-1,\n",
       "             param_grid={&#x27;classifier__max_features&#x27;: [None, &#x27;sqrt&#x27;, &#x27;log2&#x27;, 0.2,\n",
       "                                                      0.5, 0.8]},\n",
       "             scoring=&#x27;accuracy&#x27;)</pre><b>In a Jupyter environment, please rerun this cell to show the HTML representation or trust the notebook. <br />On GitHub, the HTML representation is unable to render, please try loading this page with nbviewer.org.</b></div><div class=\"sk-container\" hidden><div class=\"sk-item sk-dashed-wrapped\"><div class=\"sk-label-container\"><div class=\"sk-label fitted sk-toggleable\"><input class=\"sk-toggleable__control sk-hidden--visually\" id=\"sk-estimator-id-21\" type=\"checkbox\" ><label for=\"sk-estimator-id-21\" class=\"sk-toggleable__label fitted sk-toggleable__label-arrow\"><div><div>GridSearchCV</div></div><div><a class=\"sk-estimator-doc-link fitted\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.8/modules/generated/sklearn.model_selection.GridSearchCV.html\">?<span>Documentation for GridSearchCV</span></a><span class=\"sk-estimator-doc-link fitted\">i<span>Fitted</span></span></div></label><div class=\"sk-toggleable__content fitted\" data-param-prefix=\"\">\n",
