       "            inverse_func\n",
       "            <span class=\"param-doc-description\">inverse_func: callable, default=None<br><br>The callable to use for the inverse transformation. This will be<br>passed the same arguments as inverse transform, with args and<br>kwargs forwarded. If inverse_func is None, then inverse_func<br>will be the identity function.</span>\n",
