       "            validate\n",
       "            <span class=\"param-doc-description\">validate: bool, default=False<br><br>Indicate that the input X array should be checked before calling<br>``func``. The possibilities are:<br><br>- If False, there is no input validation.<br>- If True, then X will be converted to a 2-dimensional NumPy array or<br>  sparse matrix. If the conversion is not possible an exception is<br>  raised.<br><br>.. versionchanged:: 0.22<br>   The default of ``validate`` changed from True to False.</span>\n",
