       "            check_inverse\n",
       "            <span class=\"param-doc-description\">check_inverse: bool, default=True<br><br>Whether to check that or ``func`` followed by ``inverse_func`` leads to<br>the original inputs. It can be used for a sanity check, raising a<br>warning when the condition is not fulfilled.<br><br>.. versionadded:: 0.20</span>\n",
